	(text_box "STM32G0B0CET BluePill or BlackPill clone\n\nBOM\n- XTAL 8MHz (ECS-80-18-33B2Q-CES-TR3) 3.2x2.5 18pf 10ppm esr 30ohm drive 100uW\n- XTAL 32kHz (ECS-.327-12.5-34B-TR) 3.2x1.5 12.5pf 20ppm esr 70kohm drive 1uW\n- One USBC socket (DP = PA12 through 10k, DN = PA11)\n- DCDC (RT9742VGJ5) SOT-23-5 2A\n- 2x LEDs USERLED (green) = PC13 + PWRLED (red) (size 0805)\n- 1x USER BUTTON (PA0)\n- 1x BOOT0 BUTTON\n- RESET BUTTON (NRST))\n- 1x 4-pin SWD\n- 2x headers 20pin\n- Optional flash footprint for W25Q32JVSSIQ\n\nLESSONS AND MISTAKES\nThe DCDC is incorrect and this pinout is only used by TPS709A33DBV (TPS709A series)\nInventory had incorrect xtal caps, we did not have 30pF\nButtons are smaller than 4.5x4.5 and only 2pins of buttons can be soldered\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 20.32 0)
		(size 81.28 66.04)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "45bb9858-e488-49ba-be96-bbba38c19c15")
	)
	(text_box "PIN ASSIGNMENTS\nTotal: 48\nPower+NRST: 5 (4-7,10)\nSWD+BOOT0: 2 (35,36 PA13,PA14)\nUSB: 2 (33,34 PA11,PA12)\nUSART: 2\nOSC+OSC32: 4 (2,3,8,9 PC14,PC15,PF0,PF1)\n\nRemaining IO: 33\nWith USB-C CC pins (4), we're left with: 29\n\nSHARED PINS\n\nPA9/PA19: USART used in programming. Same pins as:\nPA11/PA12: USB used in programming\n\nON BOOT:\nPA11: USB_DM  PA9: USART1_TX\nPA12: USB_DP  PA10: USART1_RX\n\nPA3: USART2_RX\nPA2: USART2_TX\n\nUSB OPTION (G0B1CE)\nUSB on pins PA11/PA12\nUSBPD2 pins are on PD0, PD1, PD2, PD3\n\nPROGRAMMING\nUSART on pins PA9/PA10, PC10/PC11, or PA2/PA3\nI2C-bus on pins PB6/PB7 or PB10/PB11\nSPI on pins PA4/PA5/PA6/PA7 or PB12/PB13/PB14/PB15\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
